※ pl4g-test: compile=ok
※ pl4g-test: run=native exit=4
※ pl4g-test: diag=none

※ It may equally stand on the statement where the diagnostic is raised: the
※ value is lost when the assignment replaces it.
let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let a: mut u6 = 5u6
    @[expect(4006)]
    a ← 4u6
